[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_02_0010","text":"辛苦了\n看来拍到了不错的照片呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_02_0020","text":"制作人大人……\n好的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_02_0030","text":"拍摄期间……\n我一直……在想着……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_02_0040","text":"穿着这件衣服……\n与大家一同……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_02_0050","text":"站上舞台的事……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_02_0060","text":"是吗\n……你的表情很好哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_02_0070","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_02_0080","text":"真期待啊\n和大家一起办演唱会"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_02_0090","text":"呵呵……\n是的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_02_0100","text":"非常……"}]
